cmus 2.13.0

https://github.com/cmus/cmus
License: GPL-2.0-or-later; the complete product license is in LICENSE.

Upstream source is unchanged. A separate denyexec preload library and deployment launcher restrict startup and runtime access.

A PulseAudio null sink provides audio output. Media lives under DATA_DIR/workspace and native settings under DATA_DIR/config/cmus. The launcher fixes the output configuration and validates saved startup settings; denyexec applies seccomp and Landlock. The application exposes its native Unix control socket.

